10:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["Go 中根据对象大小分为 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"tiny"}],"、",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"small"}]," 和",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"large"}]," 三种对象；"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"tiny (0~16B 无指针) 对象主要分配到 class 2 的 span 中（通过 tiny allocator）；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"small (16B~32KB) 对象会被分配到 class 2 ~ class 67 的 span 中；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":"class 1 (8B) 仅用于 64 位平台上的单指针对象，使用极少；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":"large (>32KB) 对象会量身定做分配到 class0 的 span 中，直接从 mheap 上申请；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":"为对象分配内存时，会先从 mcache 上找 span，找不到就去 mcentral 上交换，还找不到就去 mheap 上申请，最后找不到就 OOM。"}],"\n"]}]
